# Structure-Preserving Neural Lyapunov Functions

Research code, exported networks, numerical results, and complete mathematical proofs accompanying **Structure-Preserving Neural Lyapunov Functions for Nonlinear Systems: Verification Conditions and Robust Stability Bounds**, by Caglar Uyulan.

The reference is the supplied SAGE Part I author manuscript. This repository does not imply journal acceptance or publication.

Formulas are displayed as scalable vector images, with the [editable LaTeX source](docs/sources/README.md.in) and a [notation and viewing guide](docs/MATH_RENDERING.md) available alongside them.

The candidate

$$V_\theta(x)=\varepsilon\|x\|_2^2+\|\phi_\theta(x)-\phi_\theta(0)\|_2^2$$

enforces the equilibrium value and a positive quadratic floor. Derivative learning, finite testing, and continuum verification have separate roles. **The archived interval results use a fixed floating-point guard. They are numerical evidence, not a validated formal machine certificate.**

